{"root":{"data":{"id":"dmx9f6jydpc0","created":1794895693919,"text":"中心主题"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmx9fk1ncs80","created":1794895723287,"text":"蓝牙位置要塑料 "},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmx9fowpqug0","created":1794895733873,"text":"透明亚克力是否可以打印？"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmx9g5a1g280","created":1794895769507,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmx9g7ddccw0","created":1794895774062,"text":"绝缘问题"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmx9gd1bglc0","created":1794895786394,"text":"塑料螺丝，这样底板也可以用铝合金"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmx9garozg80","created":1794895781459,"text":"喇叭，磁吸？"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmx9nxdlk200","created":1794896379221,"text":"电池无法充电"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmxbb63lrmo0","created":1794901021694,"text":"底板下沉1mm"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmxhjgj09pk0","created":1794918597966,"text":"放手表的地方"},"children":[]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}